This project implements the USB protocols of Pinscape Pico, and
redistributes assets derived from it (assets/: help pages, config
templates, and a schema generated from Firmware/JSONConfigRef.txt).
crates/pinscape-config/src/parser.rs is a Rust port of the firmware's
JSON parser (Firmware/JSON.cpp).

